\textbf{Definition 11} (ATK-secure encryption against
\emph{λ}-key-leakage attacks)\textbf{.} \emph{For} ATK
\emph{∈\{}CPA\emph{,} CCA\emph{\}, we say a public key encryption
scheme} Π = (Gen\emph{,} Enc\emph{,} Dec) \emph{is} ATK\emph{-secure
against λ-key-leakage}

\emph{attacks if, for every PPT λ-key-leakage adversary A} =
