\textbf{D.3} \textbf{Revisiting Naor-Segev in the ROM}

\textbf{Naor-Yung paradigm.} In the random oracle model, the Naor-Yung
(NY) construction con-

siders two encryption schemes with CPA-security Π = (Gen\emph{,}
Enc\emph{,} Dec), Π\emph{′}= (Gen\emph{′,} Enc\emph{′,} Dec\emph{′})

and a NIZK proof system (\emph{PH, VH}) for the following language:

